<title>INDIA: India lead output below target in February.</title>
<headline>India lead output below target in February.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 2,376 tonnes of lead in February 1997 against a target of 4,765 tonnes, a government statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The country produced 38,815 tonnes of lead between April 1996 and February 1997 compared with 41,201 in the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed  February,1997     Cumulative output</p>
<p>	   capacity   -------------     -----------------</p>
<p>	   (annual)	Actual	 Apr96-Feb97 Apr95-Feb96</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> HZL	 65,000	 1,377	     24,134     24,805</p>
<p> ILL</p>
<p> Secondary 24,000	   999	     14,681     16,396</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total     89,000	 2,376	     38,815     41,201</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional</p>
